{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21752","headline":"乐府古题序 将进酒 · 元稹","name":"乐府古题序 将进酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将进酒，将进酒。\n酒中有毒酖主父，言之主父伤主母。\n母爲妾地父妾天，仰天俯地不忍言。\n阳爲僵踣主父前，主父不知加妾鞭。\n旁人知妾爲主说，主将泪洗鞭头血。\n推椎主母牵下堂，扶妾遣升堂上牀。\n将进酒，酒中无毒令主寿。\n愿主廻恩归主母，遣妾如此由主父。\n妾爲此事人偶知，自慙不密方自悲。\n主今颠倒安置妾，贪天僭地谁不爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}